{
    "title": "Crozzle - Crossword Puzzles",
    "description": "Upgrade your daily brain training, crossword style! Play the word puzzle game that bumps the classic daily crossword puzzle up to a new level of word fun with strategy, competition and tons of surprises. Play is the new way to crossword! \r\n\r\nFeel smarter after every play as you solve clever clues and rack up points word by word. And don\u2019t forget to relax between daily brain workouts! Visit dreamy destinations between puzzles on the Crozzle Map and decorate your own corner of paradise!\r\n \r\nCrozzle is the daily crossword puzzle you know and love, only better. Crossword + game = way more fun! We\u2019ve gamified the classic daily crossword puzzle, so going that extra mile making words in your daily brain workout is a game, not a chore.\r\n \r\nEach game is a puzzle you solve against an opponent! Take turns adding all the letters you can until the puzzle is solved. Crossword skills are a must, but you\u2019ll also need strategy to win. Brain boosting fun right?! Here\u2019s how the game works:\r\n \r\nHow to Play\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Play a 1-on-1 crossword match versus an opponent\ud83c\udf1f\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Add as many of your letters as you can to the puzzle, then it\u2019s your opponent\u2019s turn\ud83c\udf1f\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Earn points for correctly placed letters\ud83c\udf1f\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Earn more points for completed words\ud83c\udf1f\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Earn even more points for placing letters on bonus squares!\ud83c\udf1f\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Once all the words in a puzzle are solved, the player with the most points wins!\ud83c\udf1f\r\n \r\nPretty simple eh? Here\u2019s some fun, brain busting twists!\r\n \r\nFun Features\r\n\u26a1\ufe0fFun picture clues + clever brain-training word clues\u26a1\ufe0f\r\n\u26a1\ufe0fMultiply points by placing letters in words on bonus squares\u26a1\ufe0f\r\n\u26a1\ufe0fSwap out letters you don\u2019t want to play for new ones! (costs gems)\u26a1\ufe0f\r\n\u26a1\ufe0fGain advantage with boosters like wild tile, double bonus, more letters (cost gems)\u26a1\ufe0f\r\n\u26a1\ufe0fUnlock hidden clues for words in fun daily Events!\u26a1\ufe0f\r\n \r\nStrategy sets Crozzle apart from other crosswords. The more words you play, the better your word puzzle skills and the better you\u2019ll get at outscoring opponents.\r\n \r\nThe fun doesn\u2019t stop there. You don\u2019t have to leave the game to relax and give your brain a break between daily crossword workouts!\r\n \r\nOpen the Crozzle Map to visit dreamy destinations and decorate your perfect vacation spot! Whether it\u2019s beautiful city parks, cafes and museums, tropical island getaways or fun mountain adventures, the Crozzle Map has you covered. Here\u2019s how it works:\r\n \r\nTravel & Decorate\r\n\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0fEnter the Crozzle Map to see your current location and area\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f\r\n\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0fDecorate your area by purchasing items with coins\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f\r\n\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0fFully decorate an area to unlock a new one\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f\r\n\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0fDecorate all areas in a location to unlock a new destination!\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f\r\n \r\nThere\u2019s a million reasons for crossword lovers to play this unique new word puzzle game. If you\u2019re a wiz with words, curious about crosswords and love brain training word games, here\u2019s some more reasons to play!\r\n \r\nWhy You\u2019ll Love Crozzle\r\n\u2728Thousands of quick, solvable puzzles\u2728\r\n\u2728Play words at your own pace, no timer!\u2728\r\n\u2728Challenge hard opponents\u2728\r\n\u2728Earn coins and gems with wins and frequent play\u2728\r\n\u2728Get game-boosting goodies in the shop\u2728\r\n\u2728Climb event leaderboards\u2728\r\n \r\nBrain train with the best and scratch your daily crossword itch with the smartest word puzzle game around. Stay sharp the fun way with Crozzle.\r\n \r\nNext level crossword fun!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Upgrade your daily brain training, crossword style! Play the word puzzle game that bumps the classic daily crossword puzzle up to a new level of word fun with strategy, competition and tons of surprises. Play is the new way to crossword! <br><br>Feel smarter after every play as you solve clever clues and rack up points word by word. And don\u2019t forget to relax between daily brain workouts! Visit dreamy destinations between puzzles on the Crozzle Map and decorate your own corner of paradise!<br> <br>Crozzle is the daily crossword puzzle you know and love, only better. Crossword + game = way more fun! We\u2019ve gamified the classic daily crossword puzzle, so going that extra mile making words in your daily brain workout is a game, not a chore.<br> <br>Each game is a puzzle you solve against an opponent! Take turns adding all the letters you can until the puzzle is solved. Crossword skills are a must, but you\u2019ll also need strategy to win. Brain boosting fun right?! Here\u2019s how the game works:<br> <br>How to Play<br>\ud83c\udf1f Play a 1-on-1 crossword match versus an opponent\ud83c\udf1f<br>\ud83c\udf1f Add as many of your letters as you can to the puzzle, then it\u2019s your opponent\u2019s turn\ud83c\udf1f<br>\ud83c\udf1f Earn points for correctly placed letters\ud83c\udf1f<br>\ud83c\udf1f Earn more points for completed words\ud83c\udf1f<br>\ud83c\udf1f Earn even more points for placing letters on bonus squares!\ud83c\udf1f<br>\ud83c\udf1f Once all the words in a puzzle are solved, the player with the most points wins!\ud83c\udf1f<br> <br>Pretty simple eh? Here\u2019s some fun, brain busting twists!<br> <br>Fun Features<br>\u26a1\ufe0fFun picture clues + clever brain-training word clues\u26a1\ufe0f<br>\u26a1\ufe0fMultiply points by placing letters in words on bonus squares\u26a1\ufe0f<br>\u26a1\ufe0fSwap out letters you don\u2019t want to play for new ones! (costs gems)\u26a1\ufe0f<br>\u26a1\ufe0fGain advantage with boosters like 